---
---

<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-badge">AI Engineering Agent</div>
    <h1>The AI engineering agent that works while you don't.</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">
      Vera is the async AI engineer embedded in Slack, Linear, and GitHub.
      Delegate a task in a DM — wake up to a merged pull request.
    </p>
    <p class="hero-body">
      Vera is an autonomous AI engineering agent built for teams that ship fast.
      Unlike IDE copilots that need you at the keyboard, Vera works
      asynchronously — researching codebases, triaging bugs, writing
      implementations, and opening pull requests while you focus on what matters.
      Tell Vera what to build in a Slack DM or assign a Linear ticket. She does
      the rest.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="#cta" class="btn btn-primary">Add to Slack</a>
      <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-secondary">See How It Works ↓</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.3);
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary-light);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      var(--color-text) 0%,
      var(--color-primary-light) 100%
    );
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2.5vw, 1.375rem);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .hero-body {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.875rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    min-width: 180px;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: white;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.35);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary-light);
    color: white;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.5);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    color: var(--color-text);
    border-color: var(--color-text-muted);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 4rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    }

    .hero-ctas {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .btn {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
    }
  }
</style>
